# Client Conventions

## Components

- Functional components only; no class components.
- Default-export the component from its `.jsx` file.
- Use `.jsx` for components, pages, and context; use `.js` for hooks, API, constants, and barrels.

## Folder Co-location + Barrels

Each feature lives in its own folder with a barrel `index.js`:

```
Feature/
  Feature.jsx     # component (default export)
  Feature.css     # optional co-located styles
  index.js        # export { default } from './Feature'
  components/      # page-local subcomponents, same pattern
    index.js       # export { default as Sub } from './Sub'
```

Import features through their barrel, not the inner file.

## Imports

Use the `@/` alias for `src/` imports (configured in [client/vite.config.js](client/vite.config.js)):

```js
// GOOD
import { Navbar, Footer } from '@/components'
import { ROUTES } from '@/constants/routes'

// AVOID
import Navbar from '../../../components/Navbar'
```
